  "description": "Overview Code • Compete • Conquer Competitive Programming is a high-intensity coding challenge where participants compete to solve algorithmic and problem-solving challenges within a limited time. Test your logic, algorithms, data structures, coding efficiency, accuracy, and speed against some of the brightest programmers. Eligibility Open to college students across India. Individual Participation. Dates: 16–17 October 2026 Venue: G.L. Bajaj Institute of Technology and Management Round 1 — Coding Challenge Participants will solve a set of programming problems covering: Programming Fundamentals Data Structures Algorithms Logical & Mathematical Problems Problem-Solving Round 2 — Offline Top performers will advance to a higher-difficulty round featuring challenging algorithmic problems. Participants will be evaluated based on problems solved, correctness, efficiency, and time/penalty, depending on the contest format.",
